{"schemaVersion":1,"contentId":"document-comparison-v1","facts":{},"blocks":[{"id":"d_ccf4d536dbc8e7dc_0","kind":"prose","text":"## 变量怎样分到两边？\n\n在正向运动区间，把速度与时间分别放到两边，才能各自积分。"},{"id":"d_14f16faeda3a396e_0","kind":"component","type":"comparison","data":{"items":[{"label":"速度变量","tex":"v^{-2}dv","detail":"左边只含速度及其微分。","tone":"blue"},{"label":"时间变量","tex":"-\\frac{k}{m}dt","detail":"右边只含时间及常数。","tone":"green"}]}},{"id":"d_6848d74e9c88eb6a_0","kind":"collapse","summary":"展开检查条件","blocks":[{"id":"d_8552d50570209567_0","kind":"prose","text":"这里使用了速度不为零这一条件。质量与阻力系数保持不变。"}]},{"id":"d_77f37bda85dfcc76_0","kind":"tabs","items":[{"id":"tab_0","label":"代数检查","blocks":[{"id":"d_022643191fbd267b_0","kind":"prose","text":"把整理后的式子乘回原有因子，确认两边相等。"}]},{"id":"tab_1","label":"物理检查","blocks":[{"id":"d_a0867a5e23e1f1ea_0","kind":"prose","text":"导数应与阻力导致的减速方向一致。"}]}]}]}
